    {
      "source": "Delegates to <code>HtmlUnitDriver.modifyWebClient(WebClient)</code> for default behavior\nand to <a href=\"#modifyWebClientInternal(org.htmlunit.WebClient)\"><code>modifyWebClientInternal(WebClient)</code></a> for further customization.",
      "translation": "委托给<code>HtmlUnitDriver.modifyWebClient(WebClient)</code>以获取默认行为，并委托给<a href=\"#modifyWebClientInternal(org.htmlunit.WebClient)\"><code>modifyWebClientInternal(WebClient)</code></a>以进行进一步自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is useful because it allows a\n<a href=\"../MockMvcWebConnection.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.htmlunit\"><code>MockMvcWebConnection</code></a> to be injected.",
